+	 *     at the TAIL, which pushed EAPOL behind data and broke the 4-way handshake.
+	 *   - Never call check_amsdu() under pxmitpriv->lock: it takes sta_hash_lock, and the
+	 *     nested lock throttled the xmit loop to ~12 iterations/s (~240 kbps). The dequeue
